{"n":53,"name":"An-Najm","nameAr":"النجم","meaning":"The Star","ayahs":62,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":27,"ar":"وَٱلنَّجْمِ إِذَا هَوَىٰ","en":"By the star when it descends,","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلنَّجْمِ","tr":"wal-najmi","en":"By the star","root":"نجم","lem":"نَجْم"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"هَوَىٰ","tr":"hawā","en":"it goes down","root":"هوي","lem":"هَوَى"}]},{"n":2,"juz":27,"ar":"مَا ضَلَّ صَاحِبُكُمْ وَمَا غَوَىٰ","en":"Your companion [i.e., Muḥammad] has not strayed, nor has he erred,","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"ضَلَّ","tr":"ḍalla","en":"has strayed","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضَلَّ"},{"ar":"صَاحِبُكُمْ","tr":"ṣāḥibukum","en":"your companion","root":"صحب","lem":"صاحِب"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"غَوَىٰ","tr":"ghawā","en":"has he erred","root":"غوي","lem":"غَوَى"}]},{"n":3,"juz":27,"ar":"وَمَا يَنطِقُ عَنِ ٱلْهَوَىٰٓ","en":"Nor does he speak from [his own] inclination.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"يَنطِقُ","tr":"yanṭiqu","en":"he speaks","root":"نطق","lem":"يَنطِقُ"},{"ar":"عَنِ","tr":"ʿani","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلْهَوَىٰٓ","tr":"l-hawā","en":"the desire","root":"هوي","lem":"هَواء"}]},{"n":4,"juz":27,"ar":"إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا وَحْىٌ يُوحَىٰ","en":"It is not but a revelation revealed,","w":[{"ar":"إِنْ","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"(is) except"},{"ar":"وَحْىٌۭ","tr":"waḥyun","en":"a revelation","root":"وحي","lem":"وَحْى"},{"ar":"يُوحَىٰ","tr":"yūḥā","en":"revealed","root":"وحي","lem":"أَوْحَى"}]},{"n":5,"juz":27,"ar":"عَلَّمَهُۥ شَدِيدُ ٱلْقُوَىٰ","en":"Taught to him by one intense in strength [i.e., Gabriel] -","w":[{"ar":"عَلَّمَهُۥ","tr":"ʿallamahu","en":"Has taught him","root":"علم","lem":"عَلَّمَ"},{"ar":"شَدِيدُ","tr":"shadīdu","en":"the (one) mighty","root":"شدد","lem":"شَدِيد"},{"ar":"ٱلْقُوَىٰ","tr":"l-quwā","en":"(in) power","root":"قوي","lem":"قُوَّة"}]},{"n":6,"juz":27,"ar":"ذُو مِرَّةٍ فَٱسْتَوَىٰ","en":"One of soundness. And he rose to [his] true form","w":[{"ar":"ذُو","tr":"dhū","en":"Possessor of soundness"},{"ar":"مِرَّةٍۢ","tr":"mirratin","en":"Possessor of soundness","root":"مرر","lem":"مِرَّة"},{"ar":"فَٱسْتَوَىٰ","tr":"fa-is'tawā","en":"And he rose","root":"سوي","lem":"اسْتَوَى"}]},{"n":7,"juz":27,"ar":"وَهُوَ بِٱلْأُفُقِ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","en":"While he was in the higher [part of the] horizon.","w":[{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"While he"},{"ar":"بِٱلْأُفُقِ","tr":"bil-ufuqi","en":"(was) in the horizon ","root":"أفق","lem":"أُفُق"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","tr":"l-aʿlā","en":"the highest","root":"علو","lem":"أَعْلَى"}]},{"n":8,"juz":27,"ar":"ثُمَّ دَنَا فَتَدَلَّىٰ","en":"Then he approached and descended","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"دَنَا","tr":"danā","en":"he approached","root":"دنو","lem":"دَنا"},{"ar":"فَتَدَلَّىٰ","tr":"fatadallā","en":"and came down","root":"دلو","lem":"تَدَلَّى"}]},{"n":9,"juz":27,"ar":"فَكَانَ قَابَ قَوْسَيْنِ أَوْ أَدْنَىٰ","en":"And was at a distance of two bow lengths or nearer.","w":[{"ar":"فَكَانَ","tr":"fakāna","en":"And was","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"قَابَ","tr":"qāba","en":"(at) a distance","root":"قوب","lem":"قاب"},{"ar":"قَوْسَيْنِ","tr":"qawsayni","en":"(of) two bow-(lengths)","root":"قوس","lem":"قَوْسَيْن"},{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"or"},{"ar":"أَدْنَىٰ","tr":"adnā","en":"nearer","root":"دنو","lem":"أَدْنَى"}]},{"n":10,"juz":27,"ar":"فَأَوْحَىٰٓ إِلَىٰ عَبْدِهِۦ مَآ أَوْحَىٰ","en":"And he revealed to His Servant what he revealed [i.e., conveyed].","w":[{"ar":"فَأَوْحَىٰٓ","tr":"fa-awḥā","en":"So he revealed","root":"وحي","lem":"أَوْحَى"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"عَبْدِهِۦ","tr":"ʿabdihi","en":"His slave","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبْد"},{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"أَوْحَىٰ","tr":"awḥā","en":"he revealed","root":"وحي","lem":"أَوْحَى"}]},{"n":11,"juz":27,"ar":"مَا كَذَبَ ٱلْفُؤَادُ مَا رَأَىٰٓ","en":"The heart did not lie [about] what it saw.","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"كَذَبَ","tr":"kadhaba","en":"lied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَبَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْفُؤَادُ","tr":"l-fuādu","en":"the heart","root":"فأد","lem":"فُؤاد"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"رَأَىٰٓ","tr":"raā","en":"it saw","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"}]},{"n":12,"juz":27,"ar":"أَفَتُمَـٰرُونَهُۥ عَلَىٰ مَا يَرَىٰ","en":"So will you dispute with him over what he saw?","w":[{"ar":"أَفَتُمَـٰرُونَهُۥ","tr":"afatumārūnahu","en":"Then will you dispute with him","root":"مري","lem":"تَمارَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"about"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"يَرَىٰ","tr":"yarā","en":"he saw","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"}]},{"n":13,"juz":27,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ نَزْلَةً أُخْرَىٰ","en":"And he certainly saw him in another descent","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"رَءَاهُ","tr":"raāhu","en":"he saw him","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"نَزْلَةً","tr":"nazlatan","en":"(in) descent","root":"نزل","lem":"نَزْلَة"},{"ar":"أُخْرَىٰ","tr":"ukh'rā","en":"another","root":"أخر","lem":"آخَر"}]},{"n":14,"juz":27,"ar":"عِندَ سِدْرَةِ ٱلْمُنتَهَىٰ","en":"At the Lote Tree of the Utmost Boundary -","w":[{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"Near","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"سِدْرَةِ","tr":"sid'rati","en":"(the) Lote Tree","root":"سدر","lem":"سِدْرَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُنتَهَىٰ","tr":"l-muntahā","en":"(of) the utmost boundary","root":"نهي","lem":"مُنتَهَى"}]},{"n":15,"juz":27,"ar":"عِندَهَا جَنَّةُ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰٓ","en":"Near it is the Garden of Refuge [i.e., Paradise] -","w":[{"ar":"عِندَهَا","tr":"ʿindahā","en":"Near it","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"جَنَّةُ","tr":"jannatu","en":"(is the) Garden","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰٓ","tr":"l-mawā","en":"(of) Abode","root":"أوي","lem":"مَأْوَى"}]},{"n":16,"juz":27,"ar":"إِذْ يَغْشَى ٱلسِّدْرَةَ مَا يَغْشَىٰ","en":"When there covered the Lote Tree that which covered [it].","w":[{"ar":"إِذْ","tr":"idh","en":"When"},{"ar":"يَغْشَى","tr":"yaghshā","en":"covered","root":"غشو","lem":"غَشِيَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسِّدْرَةَ","tr":"l-sid'rata","en":"the Lote Tree","root":"سدر","lem":"سِدْرَة"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"يَغْشَىٰ","tr":"yaghshā","en":"covers","root":"غشو","lem":"غَشِيَ"}]},{"n":17,"juz":27,"ar":"مَا زَاغَ ٱلْبَصَرُ وَمَا طَغَىٰ","en":"The sight [of the Prophet (ﷺ)] did not swerve, nor did it transgress [its limit].","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"زَاغَ","tr":"zāgha","en":"swerved","root":"زيغ","lem":"زاغَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَصَرُ","tr":"l-baṣaru","en":"the sight","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصَر"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"طَغَىٰ","tr":"ṭaghā","en":"it transgressed","root":"طغي","lem":"طَغَى"}]},{"n":18,"juz":27,"ar":"لَقَدْ رَأَىٰ مِنْ ءَايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰٓ","en":"He certainly saw of the greatest signs of his Lord.","w":[{"ar":"لَقَدْ","tr":"laqad","en":"Certainly"},{"ar":"رَأَىٰ","tr":"raā","en":"he saw","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","tr":"āyāti","en":"(the) Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِ","tr":"rabbihi","en":"(of) his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْكُبْرَىٰٓ","tr":"l-kub'rā","en":"the Greatest","root":"كبر","lem":"كُبْرَى"}]},{"n":19,"juz":27,"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱللَّـٰتَ وَٱلْعُزَّىٰ","en":"So have you considered al-Lāt and al-ʿUzzā?","w":[{"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ","tr":"afara-aytumu","en":"So have you seen","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"ٱللَّـٰتَ","tr":"l-lāta","en":"the Lat"},{"ar":"وَٱلْعُزَّىٰ","tr":"wal-ʿuzā","en":"and the Uzza","root":"عزز","lem":"الْعُزَّى"}]},{"n":20,"juz":27,"ar":"وَمَنَوٰةَ ٱلثَّالِثَةَ ٱلْأُخْرَىٰٓ","en":"And Manāt, the third - the other one?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَنَوٰةَ","tr":"wamanata","en":"And Manat","root":"مني","lem":"مَناة"},{"ar":"ٱلثَّالِثَةَ","tr":"l-thālithata","en":"the third","root":"ثلث","lem":"ثالِثَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْأُخْرَىٰٓ","tr":"l-ukh'rā","en":"the other","root":"أخر","lem":"آخَر"}]},{"n":21,"juz":27,"ar":"أَلَكُمُ ٱلذَّكَرُ وَلَهُ ٱلْأُنثَىٰ","en":"Is the male for you and for Him the female?","w":[{"ar":"أَلَكُمُ","tr":"alakumu","en":"Is for you"},{"ar":"ٱلذَّكَرُ","tr":"l-dhakaru","en":"the male","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذَكَر"},{"ar":"وَلَهُ","tr":"walahu","en":"and for Him"},{"ar":"ٱلْأُنثَىٰ","tr":"l-unthā","en":"the female","root":"أنث","lem":"أُنثَى"}]},{"n":22,"juz":27,"ar":"تِلْكَ إِذًا قِسْمَةٌ ضِيزَىٰٓ","en":"That, then, is an unjust division.","w":[{"ar":"تِلْكَ","tr":"til'ka","en":"This"},{"ar":"إِذًۭا","tr":"idhan","en":"then"},{"ar":"قِسْمَةٌۭ","tr":"qis'matun","en":"(is) a division","root":"قسم","lem":"قِسْمَة"},{"ar":"ضِيزَىٰٓ","tr":"ḍīzā","en":"unfair","root":"ضيز","lem":"ضِيزَى"}]},{"n":23,"juz":27,"ar":"إِنْ هِىَ إِلَّآ أَسْمَآءٌ سَمَّيْتُمُوهَآ أَنتُمْ وَءَابَآؤُكُم مَّآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ بِهَا مِن سُلْطَـٰنٍ ۚ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَمَا تَهْوَى ٱلْأَنفُسُ ۖ وَلَقَدْ جَآءَهُم مِّن رَّبِّهِمُ ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","en":"They are not but [mere] names you have named them - you and your forefathers - for which Allāh has sent down no authority. They follow not except assumption and what [their] souls desire, and there has already come to them from their Lord guidance.","w":[{"ar":"إِنْ","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"هِىَ","tr":"hiya","en":"they"},{"ar":"إِلَّآ","tr":"illā","en":"(are) except"},{"ar":"أَسْمَآءٌۭ","tr":"asmāon","en":"names","root":"سمو","lem":"اسْم"},{"ar":"سَمَّيْتُمُوهَآ","tr":"sammaytumūhā","en":"you have named them","root":"سمو","lem":"سَمَّى"},{"ar":"أَنتُمْ","tr":"antum","en":"you"},{"ar":"وَءَابَآؤُكُم","tr":"waābāukum","en":"and your forefathers","root":"أبو","lem":"آباء"},{"ar":"مَّآ","tr":"mā","en":"not"},{"ar":"أَنزَلَ","tr":"anzala","en":"has Allah sent down","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"has Allah sent down","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"بِهَا","tr":"bihā","en":"for it"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"سُلْطَـٰنٍ ۚ","tr":"sul'ṭānin","en":"authority","root":"سلط","lem":"سُلْطان"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":